{"format":2,"id":"chinese","name":"Mandarin Chinese","icon":"🐉","color":"#DC2626","category":"language","subcategory":"mandarin","tags":["voice","beginner"],"version":1,"description":"Simplified characters with pinyin, from first words to short sentences.","question":"What does “{prompt}” mean?","reverseQuestion":"How do you say “{answer}” in Mandarin?","typeable":true,"skillNoun":"Jade","lang":"zh-CN","cards":[{"id":"ni-hao","prompt":"你好 (nǐ hǎo)","answer":"hello","alts":["hi"],"options":["goodbye","thank you","good"],"fact":"你好 literally means \"you good.\"","difficulty":1},{"id":"xiexie","prompt":"谢谢 (xièxie)","answer":"thank you","alts":["thanks"],"options":["you're welcome","sorry","please"],"fact":"The second 谢 is said in a light, neutral tone.","difficulty":1},{"id":"zaijian","prompt":"再见 (zàijiàn)","answer":"goodbye","alts":["bye","see you again"],"options":["hello","good night","welcome"],"fact":"再见 literally means \"again see.\"","difficulty":1},{"id":"bu","prompt":"不 (bù)","answer":"no","alts":["not"],"options":["yes","good","big"],"fact":"不 changes to second tone (bú) before a fourth-tone syllable, as in 不客气.","difficulty":1},{"id":"yi","prompt":"一 (yī)","answer":"one","alts":["1"],"options":["two","ten","three"],"fact":"One of the simplest characters: a single horizontal stroke.","difficulty":1},{"id":"san","prompt":"三 (sān)","answer":"three","alts":["3"],"options":["two","one","ten"],"fact":"Count the strokes: 一, 二, 三 are one, two and three lines.","difficulty":1},{"id":"shi-ten","prompt":"十 (shí)","answer":"ten","alts":["10"],"options":["one","three","hundred"],"fact":"十 looks like a plus sign; 十一 (eleven) is literally \"ten one.\"","difficulty":1},{"id":"ren","prompt":"人 (rén)","answer":"person","alts":["people","man","human"],"options":["tree","mouth","big"],"fact":"人 is a pictograph of a person walking on two legs.","difficulty":1},{"id":"da","prompt":"大 (dà)","answer":"big","alts":["large"],"options":["small","tall","person"],"fact":"大 shows a person stretching their arms out wide.","difficulty":1},{"id":"xiao","prompt":"小 (xiǎo)","answer":"small","alts":["little"],"options":["big","few","short"],"fact":"Put the opposites together, 大小 (dàxiǎo), and you get \"size.\"","difficulty":1},{"id":"shui","prompt":"水 (shuǐ)","answer":"water","options":["fire","rain","river"],"fact":"As a radical, water shrinks to three drops (氵), seen in words like 河 (river).","difficulty":1},{"id":"huo","prompt":"火 (huǒ)","answer":"fire","options":["water","sun","mountain"],"fact":"A volcano is 火山 (huǒshān), a \"fire mountain.\"","difficulty":1},{"id":"shan","prompt":"山 (shān)","answer":"mountain","alts":["hill"],"options":["river","tree","fire"],"fact":"山 is a pictograph of three mountain peaks.","difficulty":1},{"id":"ri","prompt":"日 (rì)","answer":"sun","alts":["day"],"options":["moon","eye","fire"],"fact":"日本 (Rìběn), Japan, literally means \"sun origin.\"","difficulty":1},{"id":"yue","prompt":"月 (yuè)","answer":"moon","alts":["month"],"options":["sun","star","night"],"fact":"月 also means month, so 一月 (yīyuè) is January.","difficulty":1},{"id":"mao","prompt":"猫 (māo)","answer":"cat","options":["dog","horse","panda"],"fact":"Māo sounds a lot like \"meow.\"","difficulty":1},{"id":"gou","prompt":"狗 (gǒu)","answer":"dog","options":["cat","pig","bird"],"fact":"The dog is the 11th animal of the Chinese zodiac.","difficulty":1},{"id":"mama","prompt":"妈妈 (māma)","answer":"mom","alts":["mother","mum","mommy"],"options":["dad","sister","grandma"],"fact":"Tones matter: mā is \"mom,\" but mǎ (马) is \"horse.\"","difficulty":1},{"id":"baba","prompt":"爸爸 (bàba)","answer":"dad","alts":["father","daddy","papa"],"options":["mom","brother","grandpa"],"fact":"Like 妈妈, the second syllable of 爸爸 is light and toneless.","difficulty":1},{"id":"zhongguo","prompt":"中国 (Zhōngguó)","answer":"China","options":["Japan","Korea","America"],"fact":"中国 means \"Middle Kingdom\" or \"Central State.\"","difficulty":1},{"id":"wo","prompt":"我 (wǒ)","answer":"I","alts":["me"],"options":["you","he","we"],"fact":"Add 们 to make it plural: 我们 (wǒmen) means \"we.\"","difficulty":1},{"id":"cha","prompt":"茶 (chá)","answer":"tea","options":["coffee","water","milk"],"fact":"English \"chai\" echoes chá, while \"tea\" comes from the Min Chinese \"te.\"","difficulty":1},{"id":"hao","prompt":"好 (hǎo)","answer":"good","alts":["well","fine"],"options":["bad","big","new"],"fact":"好 combines 女 (woman) and 子 (child).","difficulty":1},{"id":"chi","prompt":"吃 (chī)","answer":"to eat","alts":["eat"],"options":["to drink","to speak","to cook"],"fact":"吃 has the 口 (mouth) radical on its left.","difficulty":2},{"id":"he","prompt":"喝 (hē)","answer":"to drink","alts":["drink"],"options":["to eat","to sing","to look"],"fact":"Like 吃, 喝 carries the 口 (mouth) radical.","difficulty":2},{"id":"kan","prompt":"看 (kàn)","answer":"to look","alts":["look","to see","see","to watch","watch","to read","read"],"options":["to listen","to say","to walk"],"fact":"看 shows a hand (手) held above an eye (目), shading it to look.","difficulty":2},{"id":"shuo","prompt":"说 (shuō)","answer":"to speak","alts":["speak","to say","say","to talk","talk"],"options":["to listen","to write","to read"],"fact":"The 讠 radical on the left marks words to do with speech.","difficulty":2},{"id":"xuexi","prompt":"学习 (xuéxí)","answer":"to study","alts":["study","to learn","learn"],"options":["to teach","to work","to play"],"fact":"学 alone also means \"to learn,\" as in 学生, student.","difficulty":2},{"id":"xihuan","prompt":"喜欢 (xǐhuan)","answer":"to like","alts":["like"],"options":["to want","to need","to hate"],"fact":"我喜欢你 (wǒ xǐhuan nǐ) means \"I like you.\"","difficulty":2},{"id":"pengyou","prompt":"朋友 (péngyou)","answer":"friend","alts":["friends"],"options":["teacher","neighbor","family"],"fact":"A boyfriend is 男朋友, literally \"male friend.\"","difficulty":2},{"id":"laoshi","prompt":"老师 (lǎoshī)","answer":"teacher","options":["student","doctor","friend"],"fact":"China celebrates Teachers' Day on September 10.","difficulty":2},{"id":"yisheng","prompt":"医生 (yīshēng)","answer":"doctor","options":["teacher","nurse","student"],"fact":"医 means medicine, so a hospital is 医院 (yīyuàn).","difficulty":2},{"id":"jintian","prompt":"今天 (jīntiān)","answer":"today","options":["tomorrow","yesterday","tonight"],"fact":"天 means both \"day\" and \"sky.\"","difficulty":2},{"id":"mingtian","prompt":"明天 (míngtiān)","answer":"tomorrow","options":["today","yesterday","next week"],"fact":"明天见 (míngtiān jiàn) means \"see you tomorrow.\"","difficulty":2},{"id":"piaoliang","prompt":"漂亮 (piàoliang)","answer":"beautiful","alts":["pretty"],"options":["ugly","clever","tall"],"fact":"漂亮 can describe people, clothes, or even a well-played shot.","difficulty":2},{"id":"gaoxing","prompt":"高兴 (gāoxìng)","answer":"happy","alts":["glad"],"options":["sad","angry","tired"],"fact":"认识你很高兴 means \"I'm happy to meet you.\"","difficulty":2},{"id":"duibuqi","prompt":"对不起 (duìbuqǐ)","answer":"sorry","alts":["I'm sorry","I am sorry"],"options":["thank you","excuse me","no problem"],"fact":"The usual reply is 没关系 (méi guānxi), \"it doesn't matter.\"","difficulty":2},{"id":"mei-guanxi","prompt":"没关系 (méi guānxi)","answer":"it doesn't matter","alts":["it does not matter","never mind","no problem","that's okay"],"options":["I don't know","it's not mine","I'm sorry"],"fact":"Literally \"no relation,\" it is the standard way to accept an apology.","difficulty":2},{"id":"bu-keqi","prompt":"不客气 (bú kèqi)","answer":"you're welcome","alts":["you are welcome"],"options":["thank you","excuse me","please"],"fact":"Literally \"don't be a guest,\" i.e. no need for politeness.","difficulty":2},{"id":"zaoshang-hao","prompt":"早上好 (zǎoshang hǎo)","answer":"good morning","options":["good night","good afternoon","goodbye"],"fact":"Among friends, a simple 早 (zǎo, \"early!\") works too.","difficulty":2},{"id":"diannao","prompt":"电脑 (diànnǎo)","answer":"computer","options":["television","telephone","radio"],"fact":"电脑 literally means \"electric brain.\"","difficulty":2},{"id":"xiongmao","prompt":"熊猫 (xióngmāo)","answer":"panda","alts":["giant panda"],"options":["bear","tiger","raccoon"],"fact":"熊猫 literally means \"bear cat.\"","difficulty":2},{"id":"feiji","prompt":"飞机 (fēijī)","answer":"airplane","alts":["plane","aeroplane","aircraft"],"options":["train","bird","boat"],"fact":"飞机 literally means \"flying machine.\"","difficulty":2},{"id":"huoche","prompt":"火车 (huǒchē)","answer":"train","options":["car","bus","fire truck"],"fact":"火车, \"fire vehicle,\" dates from the era of steam trains.","difficulty":2},{"id":"shouji","prompt":"手机 (shǒujī)","answer":"mobile phone","alts":["cell phone","cellphone","phone","mobile","smartphone"],"options":["computer","camera","watch"],"fact":"手机 literally means \"hand machine.\"","difficulty":2},{"id":"zhongwen","prompt":"中文 (Zhōngwén)","answer":"Chinese","alts":["Chinese language"],"options":["English","Japanese","Korean"],"fact":"文 means writing or language; 英文 (Yīngwén) is English.","difficulty":2},{"id":"ganbei","prompt":"干杯 (gānbēi)","answer":"cheers","options":["good luck","thank you","bon appétit"],"fact":"干杯 literally means \"dry cup,\" so you are meant to empty your glass.","difficulty":2},{"id":"ming","prompt":"明 (míng)","answer":"bright","alts":["clear","light"],"options":["dark","hot","early"],"fact":"明 puts the sun (日) beside the moon (月): bright!","difficulty":2},{"id":"ni-hao-ma","prompt":"你好吗？(nǐ hǎo ma?)","answer":"How are you?","options":["What is your name?","Where are you?","Who are you?"],"fact":"Adding 吗 (ma) turns a statement into a yes-or-no question.","difficulty":2},{"id":"wo-ai-ni","prompt":"我爱你 (wǒ ài nǐ)","answer":"I love you","options":["I like tea","I miss you","I know you"],"fact":"The traditional form of 爱 is 愛, which has 心 (heart) at its center.","difficulty":3},{"id":"ni-jiao-shenme-mingzi","prompt":"你叫什么名字？(nǐ jiào shénme míngzi?)","answer":"What is your name?","alts":["What's your name?"],"options":["How old are you?","Where do you live?","What do you want?"],"fact":"叫 (jiào) means \"to be called,\" so it is literally \"You are called what name?\"","difficulty":3},{"id":"wo-shi-xuesheng","prompt":"我是学生 (wǒ shì xuésheng)","answer":"I am a student","alts":["I'm a student"],"options":["I am a teacher","I like school","I study Chinese"],"fact":"是 (shì) links two nouns, like \"am/is/are\" in English.","difficulty":3},{"id":"wo-bu-dong","prompt":"我不懂 (wǒ bù dǒng)","answer":"I don't understand","alts":["I do not understand"],"options":["I don't know","I can't hear","I don't want"],"fact":"不 stays fourth tone here because 懂 is a third-tone word.","difficulty":3},{"id":"ni-hui-shuo-yingyu-ma","prompt":"你会说英语吗？(nǐ huì shuō Yīngyǔ ma?)","answer":"Can you speak English?","alts":["Do you speak English?"],"options":["Are you English?","Do you like English?","Can you write Chinese?"],"fact":"会 (huì) means \"can\" in the sense of a learned skill.","difficulty":3},{"id":"cesuo-zai-nali","prompt":"厕所在哪里？(cèsuǒ zài nǎlǐ?)","answer":"Where is the toilet?","alts":["Where is the bathroom?","Where is the restroom?","Where's the toilet?","Where's the bathroom?"],"options":["Where is the hotel?","Where is the exit?","Is the toilet free?"],"fact":"In northern China you will often hear 哪儿 (nǎr) instead of 哪里.","difficulty":3},{"id":"wo-e-le","prompt":"我饿了 (wǒ è le)","answer":"I'm hungry","alts":["I am hungry"],"options":["I'm tired","I'm full","I'm thirsty"],"fact":"了 (le) here signals a change of state: \"I've become hungry.\"","difficulty":3},{"id":"jintian-hen-leng","prompt":"今天很冷 (jīntiān hěn lěng)","answer":"It's very cold today","alts":["It is very cold today","It's cold today","It is cold today","Today is very cold","Today is cold"],"options":["It's very hot today","Tomorrow will be cold","It's raining today"],"fact":"很 often just links a subject and adjective, so it can be weaker than \"very.\"","difficulty":3},{"id":"wo-xihuan-he-cha","prompt":"我喜欢喝茶 (wǒ xǐhuan hē chá)","answer":"I like to drink tea","alts":["I like drinking tea","I like tea"],"options":["I want to drink water","I like to eat rice","I don't like tea"],"fact":"China is the world's largest producer of tea.","difficulty":3},{"id":"qing-zai-shuo-yi-bian","prompt":"请再说一遍 (qǐng zài shuō yí biàn)","answer":"Please say it again","alts":["Please say that again","Please repeat","Please repeat that"],"options":["Please speak slowly","Please write it down","Please come again"],"fact":"遍 (biàn) counts times through something, from start to finish.","difficulty":3},{"id":"xianzai-ji-dian","prompt":"现在几点？(xiànzài jǐ diǎn?)","answer":"What time is it?","alts":["What time is it now?"],"options":["What day is it?","Where are we now?","How long is it?"],"fact":"点 (diǎn) means \"dot\" and also \"o'clock.\"","difficulty":3},{"id":"zhege-duoshao-qian","prompt":"这个多少钱？(zhège duōshao qián?)","answer":"How much is this?","alts":["How much does this cost?"],"options":["What is this?","Is this cheap?","Can I buy this?"],"fact":"钱 (qián) means money, so 多少钱 is literally \"how much money.\"","difficulty":3},{"id":"women-zou-ba","prompt":"我们走吧 (wǒmen zǒu ba)","answer":"Let's go","alts":["Let us go"],"options":["We're lost","Let's eat","We're home"],"fact":"吧 (ba) at the end softens a sentence into a suggestion.","difficulty":3},{"id":"ta-shi-wo-de-pengyou","prompt":"他是我的朋友 (tā shì wǒ de péngyou)","answer":"He is my friend","alts":["He's my friend"],"options":["She is my sister","He is my teacher","I am his friend"],"fact":"他 (he) and 她 (she) are both pronounced tā; only the writing differs.","difficulty":3},{"id":"mamahuhu","prompt":"马马虎虎 (mǎmǎhūhū)","answer":"so-so","alts":["so so","okay","not bad"],"options":["very good","terrible","in a hurry"],"fact":"马马虎虎 literally means \"horse horse tiger tiger.\"","difficulty":3}]}